      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KAHULA (6) led and was too good in last week's heat, getting home by close to 6m at this circuit and distance. That was her first outing for seven weeks following her close third against the boys in the G1 Protostar in Brisbane. Expect her to be better for the last hitout so she must go on top. LA CANTATRICE (11) is really delivering now having put three wins together, the last two coming at this circuit and distance. Tougher task from the back row but with even luck she can get into the finish. SOHO SPARKLE (4) was having just her second race start when she resumed with a placing in the heats. Open to improvement as is LATHER ME UP (3) who draws better than when she resumed last week and did manage a Group 1 placing last campaign.",
